# Copy to `.env` and fill in. `.env` is gitignored.

# --- Anthropic (server-side only; never exposed to the browser) -------------
# Used by src/server/simplify.ts to shorten pasted requirements with Haiku 4.5.
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=sk-ant-...

# --- Clerk (auth gate on the AI feature) ------------------------------------
# From https://dashboard.clerk.com -> your app -> API keys
VITE_CLERK_PUBLISHABLE_KEY=pk_test_...
CLERK_SECRET_KEY=sk_test_...
